  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "拍拚學台文ê收成"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>徐婷瑩 Tshî Tîng-îng</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我tuì 2021年開始接觸台文，ē記得2021年年底，我tī面冊寫講希望以後有機會ē-tàng上正式ê台文課，kā基礎建立--起-來。目一nih，18禮拜ê課程liam-mi就beh結束--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐禮拜我lóng紮我ê筆電pha-pha走，tī高鐵寫作業、tī嘉義寫作業、tī宜蘭寫作業，tī台中厝--裡寫作業，有tang時kā代誌tshik-tshik--leh，留tī台北ê房間寫作業。Án-ne寫--leh、寫--leh，我ê台文ná來ná進步，m̄-nā拍台文ê速度變緊，甚至慣勢拍台文，tsit-má顛倒beh拍ㄅㄆㄇê時tsūn tsíng頭仔無hiah liú-lia̍h。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上kài重要--ê是，我總算ē-sái kā台語記錄--落-來--ah。羅馬字親像一台錄音機，kā聲、調、腔口差lóng錄--起-來。Lán koh kā羅馬字一字一字讀--出-來，讀出親人ê聲，mā親像看著伊ê影，感情有thang寄託，心mā khah安定--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit段時間真多謝老師ê指導，mā多謝老師kah其他台語sia̋n-pái一直tī台語界拍拚，hōo阮tsia-ê khah少年輩--ê beh越頭kā家己ê母語khioh--tńg-來ê時tsūn揣有路，hōo阮thang tuè lín ê跤步行。Suà--落-來，我按算加入讀冊會，揣台語路ê朋友做伴。若是未來我有囡仔，我一定ē kah伊講台語、教伊羅馬字，hōo伊知影伊是tsiâ。Mā希望台語ē-tàng年年興、代代湠！&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者目前tī會計師事務所服務，是「Ē liàn-tńg台文讀寫基礎班」結業ê學員。）</span></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"m